  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">傳說</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/999344/description_3b07a6ad-1671-44b1-853d-c97ee01f9572.png\"></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">作者：ClouddyVR</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><img src=\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/rLG4JWwOPf4/hq720.jpg?sqp=-oaymwEhCK4FEIIDSFryq4qpAxMIARUAAAAAGAElAADIQj0AgKJD&rs=AOn4CLA9VyS5Mt6Gb0vISkkupc-6WtO-WQ\" alt=\"This Minecraft Horror Mod Torture Villagers...\" width=\"938\" height=\"528\"></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>標籤說明：</strong>此頁面的標籤主要用於搜尋/發現，並不代表模組的實際功能，因為該模組早已遺棄並停止更新很長一段時間了。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">粉絲編輯版由 <span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">D0N5399</span> 製作</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span><span><iframe style=\"width:742px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/zY9EL1CDtv0\" width=\"742\" height=\"437\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>🔥🔥歡迎加入我們的 Discord 伺服器與我們交流！🔥🔥</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://discord.gg/22XBKVvatJ\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/22XBKVvatJ</a></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://discord.gg/rdbKq6hPD9\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/rdbKq6hPD9</a></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>如果你為本模組製作了影片，無論大小，你的影片都會在這裡展示！</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/WzJraatYQK8\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#843fa1\"><strong><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/2GPyhXPZd9Q\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#843fa1\"><strong><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/N3hpPKjGMcM\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#843fa1\"><strong><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/C6p4HwnMgCg\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/1EX6BfjwXOI\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/fEu6CqtqGc4\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/N3hpPKjGMcM\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/4do7i6bsISI\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/gvr47sPYBZs\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/-jMFun9pWag\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/cKHU87oynzU\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/9PEyZDOcSzQ\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">&hearts;️粉絲創作&hearts;️</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/999344/description_f961b504-698b-42ec-8049-2d62ddad565f.png\"></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/999344/description_1cc057b2-cbf3-4afd-82ee-d03516abf02a.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">若想移植本模組，請在 Discord 上向 @CLOUDDYVR 取得授權</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">若未獲得許可……你將因著作權問題遭到 Clouddy 舉報！</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#236fa1\">特別感謝 Clouddy 和 Gargin</span></p>",
